71
00:02:43,980 --> 00:02:45,350
The body may begin in the same

72
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:47,820
place. Does the night end there?

73
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:51,430
Baland Jalal and Devon
Hinton compared specific

74
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:53,260
