the Danish sample.

81
00:03:10,020 --> 00:03:12,420
Egyptian participants
also reported greater

82
00:03:12,500 --> 00:03:15,280
fear, longer immobility,
and more lifetime

83
00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:18,700
episodes. Within the
Egyptian group, supernatural

84
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:21,420
